# What the .vsix must not carry. This is VS Code's mechanism for that: the build no longer
# copies the agent into an intermediate folder, vsce packages this folder as it is.
#
# What goes into the package: src/ (the code and media/), package.json and the two
# package.nls*.json that translate it, README.md (the Marketplace page), LICENSE and NOTICE.
.vscode/**
.vscodeignore
# vsce 4 no longer excludes hidden files by itself: without this line, the published .vsix
# carries the project's .gitignore.
.gitignore
tests/**
.vscode-test/**
# The manual verification checklist: tooling, like the tests above.
TESTING.md
store/**
node_modules/**
dist/**
Makefile
build.mjs
eslint.config.mjs
# Type checking (npm run lint:types): tooling, like the linters above.
jsconfig.json
package-lock.json
